{"context": "published", "host": "www.josephsmithpapers.org", "showHeader": true, "footerStyle": "mini", "statusCode": 200, "uri": "letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830", "page": "2", "is404": false, "gallery": [{"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_128_thumb.jpg", "page": "1", "label": "128", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/1"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_129_thumb.jpg", "page": "2", "label": "129", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/2"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_130_thumb.jpg", "page": "3", "label": "130", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/3"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_131_thumb.jpg", "page": "4", "label": "131", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/4"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_132_thumb.jpg", "page": "5", "label": "132", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/5"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_133_thumb.jpg", "page": "6", "label": "133", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/6"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_134_thumb.jpg", "page": "7", "label": "134", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/7"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_135_thumb.jpg", "page": "8", "label": "135", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/8"}, {"image": "/6483/6483_ppallen_136_thumb.jpg", "page": "9", "label": "136", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830/9"}], "tableOfContents": [], "summary": {"uri": "letter-to-newel-knight-and-the-church-in-colesville-28-august-1830", "series": "JSPPD", "urlTitleValue": "JSPPD1", "documentSeriesTitle": "Letter to Newel Knight and the Church in Colesville, 28 August 1830", "editorialPageNumber": "129", "isPageNumberPresent": true, "searchUrl": "/published/jsp/searchable/papers/26070/26070-0002.xml", "clearText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> and supplicate at the Throne of grace,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"5431509142742036192\"><a href=\"#5431509142742036192\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans3\"><span id=\"documenttrans3\">3</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=521\" class=\"externalLink\">515</a>, <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=582\" class=\"externalLink\">576</a> [4 Nephi 1:12; Moroni 6:5]; and Hebrews 4:16.</p><hr></div></div></aside> that the spirit of the Lord may always rest upon you.<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"1427576191051675732\"><a href=\"#1427576191051675732\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans4\"><span id=\"documenttrans4\">4</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See the sacramental prayers in Articles and Covenants, ca. Apr. 1830, in <a href=\"/paper-summary/book-of-commandments-1833/51\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers-text/tooltip/book-of-commandments-1833\" poptitle=\"Chapter 24 • Articles and Covenants, circa April 1830 [D&amp;C 20]\">Book of Commandments 24:57, 59</a> [D&amp;C 20:77, 79].</p><hr></div></div></aside> Remember that without asking we can receive nothing, therefore ask in faith, and ye shall receive such blessings as God sees fit to bestow upon you. Pray not with covetous hearts that ye may consume it upon your lusts, but pray earnestly for the best gifts— fight the good fight of faith, that ye may gain the Crown which is laid up for those [p. 129]</div></body></html>", "expandedText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> and supplicate at the Throne <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>of grace,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"619644440366825228\"><a href=\"#619644440366825228\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans3\"><span id=\"documenttrans3\">3</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=521\" class=\"externalLink\">515</a>, <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=582\" class=\"externalLink\">576</a> [4 Nephi 1:12; Moroni 6:5]; and Hebrews 4:16.</p><hr></div></div></aside> that the spirit of the <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>Lord may always rest upon <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>you.<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"4915611750679304829\"><a href=\"#4915611750679304829\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans4\"><span id=\"documenttrans4\">4</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See the sacramental prayers in Articles and Covenants, ca. Apr. 1830, in <a href=\"/paper-summary/book-of-commandments-1833/51\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers-text/tooltip/book-of-commandments-1833\" poptitle=\"Chapter 24 • Articles and Covenants, circa April 1830 [D&amp;C 20]\">Book of Commandments 24:57, 59</a> [D&amp;C 20:77, 79].</p><hr></div></div></aside> Remember that with<span class=\"line-break hyphenate\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>out asking we can receive <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>nothing, therefore ask in <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>faith, and ye shall receive <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>such blessings as God sees <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>fit to bestow upon you. <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>Pray not with covetous <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>hearts that ye may consume <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>it upon your lusts, but pray <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>earnestly for the best gifts— <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>fight the good fight of faith, <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>that ye may gain the Crown <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>which is laid up <span class=\"deleted\">in</span> for those [p. 129]</div></body></html>", "calendarsOfDocuments": [], "versions": [], "images": {"smallImageUrl": "/6483/6483_ppallen_129_thumb.jpg", "mediumImageUrl": "/6483/6483_ppallen_129_med.jpg", "largeImageUrl": "/6483/6483_ppallen_129.jpg", "downloadImageUrl": "/6483/6483_ppallen_129_download.jpg"}, "imageCredit": "", "facsimile": "", "dzUrlXml": "/6483/6483_ppallen_129.xml", "classification": "Documents", "publishedStatus": "FinalContent", "accessionNumber": "6483", "requestedPageNumber": "2", "numberOfPages": "9", "editorialTitle": "Letter to Newel Knight and the Church in Colesville, 28 August 1830", "cleanEditorialTitle": "Letter to Newel Knight and the Church in Colesville, 28 August 1830", "date": "August 28, 1830", "handwriting": "No handwriting information was found.", "footnotes": [{"id": "619644440366825228", "text": "<html><head></head><body><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=521\" class=\"externalLink\">515</a>, <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=582\" class=\"externalLink\">576</